        <DTC number="8328">
          <ERRORTEXT>"A" Camshaft Position Actuator Control Circuit Low</ERRORTEXT>
          <RECORD>
            <RECORDITEM itemmappingref="_1">Bank 1</RECORDITEM>
            <RECORDITEM itemmappingref="_2">The "A" camshaft shall be either the "intake," "left," or "front camshaft. Left/Right and Front/Rear are determined as viewed from the driver's seating position.  Bank 1 contains cylinder number one, Bank 2 is the opposite bank. (For DTCs P2088 - P2095 also see P0010 - P0023)</RECORDITEM>
